01:01:55.170 --> 01:02:12.389
And he didn't tell me until, I actually met him the same weekend I met my wife, but he is now a very dear friend and he didn't reveal to me until years into our friendship that he learned English from how I met your mother in Scrubs.
他没有告诉我，直到我在认识我妻子的同一个周末才认识了他，但他现在是一个非常亲密的朋友，直到我们的友谊多年后他才向我透露，他从我在《实习医生风云》中认识你母亲的过程中学会了英语。

01:02:12.389 --> 01:02:21.530
And how I met your mother were the two shows that he just knew backwards and forwards and kind of taught him about America and all this stuff.
我是如何认识你母亲的，这两部剧让他了解了很多，并且教会了他关于美国和所有这些东西。

01:02:21.530 --> 01:02:22.369
So.
所以。

01:02:22.369 --> 01:02:23.210
Oh my God, what an honor.
天啊，多么荣幸啊。

01:02:23.210 --> 01:02:27.969
I mean, what an honor that it could be part of someone's journey in learning English and that it continues to mean something.
我的意思是，它能够成为某人学习英语之旅的一部分，并且它仍然具有某种意义，这是多么荣幸。

01:02:27.969 --> 01:02:29.449
Pardic, thank you so much.
帕迪克，非常感谢你。

01:02:29.449 --> 01:02:31.170
That was an amazing letter.
那是一封令人惊奇的信。

01:02:31.170 --> 01:02:36.039
Thanks for letting us be part of your story, honestly, it means a lot.
感谢您让我们成为您故事的一部分，老实说，这意义重大。

